Description: Agent Workflow Platform outbound WebSocket worker
 The VM agent dials an Agent Workflow Platform control plane, authenticates,
 receives generic task envelopes, supervises allowlisted child processes, and
 streams progress and logs. This package structure is review-only; its lifecycle
 hooks exit 77 until a signed release is published.